    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE PORTS AND AIRPORTS DEVELOPMENT LEVYACT, NO. 18 OF 2011",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      268.61,
      401.9,
      292.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      307.61,
      401.88,
      357.95
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Ports and AirportsDevelopment Levy (Amendment) Act, No. of 2020 andshall be deemed to have come into operation onDecember 6, 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      372.65,
      401.9,
      435.95
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Ports and Airports Development LevyAct, No. 18 of 2011 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the repeal of subsection(1) thereof and substitution therefor of the followingsubsection:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      450.53,
      401.89,
      487.91
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(1) The levy to be charged and levied in respectof the cost, insurance and freight value of any articlereferred to in section 2 shall be calculated \u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.61,
      502.61,
      401.88,
      539.87
    ],
    "text": "(a) at the rate of 5.0 per centum,for the periodcommencing on January 1, 2011 and endingon December 31, 2015;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.61,
      554.57,
      401.88,
      591.95
    ],
    "text": "(b) at the rate of 7.5 per centum,for the periodcommencing on January 1, 2016 and endingon December 5, 2019; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      210.33,
      606.53,
      401.86,
      630.95
    ],
    "text": "(c) at the rate of 10 per centum, on and afterDecember 6, 2019 .\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      645.53,
      401.88,
      669.95
    ],
    "text": "3.Where the Director-General of Customscharges or collects the Levy as provided in subsection (1)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
